# None of the following is COPYed into the image, so keeping it out of the build context saves the
# upload to the daemon and the layer-cache churn on every deploy. The launch video alone is 20 MB,
# more than everything the image actually needs.
#
# frontend/public is deliberately NOT here: `npm run build` copies it into dist/, which is the
# console's evidence data.
*.mp4
media
deploy
frontend/checks
recordings/**/*.npz
